<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>What is GPT-Live-1?</h3><p>It is OpenAI's API model for building natural, full-duplex voice experiences.</p><h3>Can it use tools?</h3><p>OpenAI says it can work with paired models and tools that handle deeper reasoning and actions.</p><h3>Should a voice model directly execute sensitive actions?</h3><p>No. Sensitive operations should pass through explicit authorization and policy checks.</p>
